  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">KEN004N Kenya DRA Drought Response</narrative>
  </title>
  <description promeva:title="Description (English)" promeva:type="104" type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Acute Crisis Joint Response will be implemented in four most affected Counties in the Northern part of Kenya, namely, Wajir, Marsabit, Turkana and Mandera. Following the National Drought Early Warning Bulletin (June 2022) this Joint response will focus on the sectors Food Security, Wash, Nutrition and MPC, where Protection is being mainstreamed in all the activities. CARE programming focuses on Multi-Purpose Cash Assistance and WASH.</narrative>
  </description>
